Fonts
-----

No font files are in this repository. The font catalogue in src/text/ is a
list of family names fetched from Google Fonts by
scripts/fetch-google-fonts.mjs; a font is downloaded from Google Fonts to the
user's own browser when they pick it, under that font's own licence.

